Note on scope

This license covers the source code, documentation and evaluation question
sets in this repository.

It does not cover:

  - The third-party language models referenced by name (Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507,
    bge-base-zh-v1.5, bge-reranker-base). They are downloaded separately and
    governed by their own licenses; see NOTICE.
  - The academic papers compiled into the corpus PDF. Their copyright belongs to
    their authors and publishers. This repository redistributes only the
    manifest (title, arXiv ID, page ranges), never the PDF itself.
  - PyMuPDF (AGPL-3.0), which this project depends on for PDF text extraction.
    See NOTICE for what that implies if you deploy the service over a network.
